<% content_for :title, "Disclaimer · Nuclear Directory" %>
<% content_for :head do %>
  <meta name="description" content="Nuclear Directory is built from public sources. It may be incomplete or out of date, and it isn't safety or investment advice.">
<% end %>
<%= render "shared/site_header" %>

<main class="nd-page nd-page--narrow nd-prose">
  <h1 class="type-title-md">Disclaimer</h1>
  <p class="type-body"><strong>In short:</strong> Nuclear Directory is a reference built from public sources. Check a fact's source before you rely on it.</p>

  <section aria-labelledby="sources">
    <h2 id="sources" class="type-body-strong">Sources</h2>
    <p class="type-body">Every fact comes from a public source.</p>
    <ul class="type-body">
      <li>Sources are company announcements, regulator filings and news reports.</li>
      <li>Each fact links to the source it came from and shows when we last checked it.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section aria-labelledby="currency">
    <h2 id="currency" class="type-body-strong">Accuracy</h2>
    <p class="type-body">The directory may be incomplete or out of date.</p>
    <ul class="type-body">
      <li>Companies change names, deals end and plans move.</li>
      <li>Check the source and its date before you rely on a fact.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section aria-labelledby="advice">
    <h2 id="advice" class="type-body-strong">Advice</h2>
    <p class="type-body">Nothing here is safety, engineering, legal or investment advice.</p>
  </section>

  <section aria-labelledby="endorsement">
    <h2 id="endorsement" class="type-body-strong">Endorsement</h2>
    <p class="type-body">A company, plant or deal appears because a source reports it, not because we recommend it.</p>
  </section>

  <section aria-labelledby="mistakes">
    <h2 id="mistakes" class="type-body-strong">Corrections</h2>
    <p class="type-body">Use "Report a correction" next to any fact, or email <%= mail_to DirectoryHelper::CORRECTIONS_EMAIL, nil, class: "nd-link" %>. We check every correction against its source.</p>
  </section>
</main>
